Description: @DISPLAY_NAME@
 Feed an iPhone or iPad running Moblin into a v4l2loopback device and the audio
 into a PulseAudio, PipeWire or ALSA virtual microphone, over the USB cable, so
 that every program that can use a camera can use the device.
 .
 The same camera inside OBS Studio is in the @OBS_PLUGIN@ package.
